{# Forward zone for the DISCONNECTED hosted cluster (hosted_domain_disconnected).

   Structurally identical to hosted_domain.j2 - it is deliberately its own zone
   rather than extra records in hcp-cluster1's, so the disconnected cluster's
   api/api-int and *.apps are distinct names on distinct addresses and both
   clusters can be up on this lab at once.

   api/api-int are the hosted cluster's kube-apiserver VIP, handed out by
   MetalLB on whichever hub currently runs its control plane. Both the
   address and the network it sits on come from hosted_cluster_metallb_pools
   (vars.yaml) for the hub named by target_hub - the same map and the same
   hub selector roles/setup-hub-acm renders that cluster's single-address
   IPAddressPool from, so this zone and that pool cannot drift apart.

   The disconnected cluster normally lives on the disconnected hub, so render
   this zone with that hub selected:
     ansible-playbook -i inventory/hosts setup_bm_host.yaml --tags dns \
       --ask-vault-pass -e target_hub=hubd
   and, exactly as for the connected zones, re-render with -e target_hub=hub2
   if it is ever restored onto the DR hub.

   *.apps points at ip_list.c1dlb, the disconnected cluster's own haproxy VIP on
   the helper (roles/setup-lb), whose backends are the c1dworker* addresses.

   The leading label of hosted_domain_disconnected is the HostedCluster name,
   which is how the zone and the pool map are keyed together. -#}
{% set hcp_name = hosted_domain_disconnected.split('.') | first -%}
{% set metallb_prefix = (hosted_cluster_metallb_network_prefixes | default({}))[target_hub] | default(lab_network_prefix) -%}
$TTL 1D
@	IN SOA	helper.{{ hub_domain }}. root.{{hub_domain }}. (
					0	; serial
					1D	; refresh
					1H	; retry
					1W	; expire
					3H )	; minimum
		NS	helper.{{ hub_domain }}.
worker1		A	{{ lab_network_prefix }}.{{ ip_list.c1dworker1 }}
worker2		A	{{ lab_network_prefix }}.{{ ip_list.c1dworker2 }}
worker3		A	{{ lab_network_prefix }}.{{ ip_list.c1dworker3 }}
api		A	{{ metallb_prefix }}.{{ hosted_cluster_metallb_pools[hcp_name].ip[target_hub] }}
api-int		A	{{ metallb_prefix }}.{{ hosted_cluster_metallb_pools[hcp_name].ip[target_hub] }}
*.apps		A	{{ lab_network_prefix }}.{{ ip_list.c1dlb }}
